Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person1:
	.string "Welcome! This facility is getting\n"
	.string "ready for challengers. Please come\l"
	.string "back soon!$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person2:
	.string "Welcome! This facility is getting\n"
	.string "ready for challengers. Please come\l"
	.string "back soon!$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person3:
	.string "The BATTLE ARCADE's roulette changes\n"
	.string "everything! I can feel it...$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person4:
	.string "The arcade's lights are so bright! Can\n"
	.string "I get you a drink?$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person5:
	.string "I love the arcade! You never know\n"
	.string "what'll happen.$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person6:
	.string "Luck is part of battling here. I'm\n"
	.string "feeling lucky today!$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person7:
	.string "I help keep the arcade's machines\n"
	.string "running. They spin so fast!$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person8:
	.string "The roulette gave me a weather change\n"
	.string "once. It totally saved me!$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person9:
	.string "I want to try the roulette! Wheee!$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person10:
	.string "The arcade's lights are so pretty.\n"
	.string "Even in the daytime!$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person11:
	.string "I came down from the mountains for\n"
	.string "the arcade. It's so noisy!$"

Sinnoh_BattleArcade_Text_Person12:
	.string "My friend dragged me here. I'm\n"
	.string "starting to like it!$"

